/tmp/vllm-claim0015-83328/docs/features/quantization/inc.md:3:[AutoRound](https://github.com/intel/auto-round) is Intel’s advanced quantization algorithm designed for large language models(LLMs). It produces highly efficient **INT2, INT3, INT4, INT8, MXFP8, MXFP4, NVFP4**, and **GGUF** quantized models, balancing accuracy and inference performance. AutoRound is also part of the [Intel® Neural Compressor](https://github.com/intel/neural-compressor). For a deeper introduction, see the [AutoRound step-by-step guide](https://github.com/intel/auto-round/blob/main/docs/step_by_step.md).
